# React Native Standards

## SDK & Navigation
- Expo SDK 51 only — no bare React Native workflow
- React Navigation v6 for all navigation

## Safe Areas
- Wrap every screen in `SafeAreaProvider` + `SafeAreaView`
- Never hardcode status bar heights or insets

## Animations & Gestures
- All animations must use **React Native Reanimated 2** — never use `Animated` from React Native core
- All gestures must use **React Native Gesture Handler**

## FlatList
Every `FlatList` must include:
```tsx
<FlatList
  keyExtractor={(item) => item.id}
  removeClippedSubviews={true}
  windowSize={10}
  // ...
/>
```

## Touch Targets
- Minimum touch target size: **44×44px** — use `minWidth`/`minHeight` or `hitSlop`

## Orientation & Platform
- Portrait orientation only — lock in `app.json`
- No iPad support
